A warehouse where robots are used to do tasks
There are N numbers of robots
Each robots are assigned task
Task is like picking item from certain position and put to target position
A robot can do 1 task at a time

class WarehouseTaskOrchestrator:
ConcurrentHashMap<Integer, Task> tasks
ConcurrentHashMap<Integer, ReentrantLock> robotLocks
RobotSelectionStrategy robotSelectionStrategy
assignTaskToRobot(int taskId)

interface RobotSelectionStrategy
selectBestRobot()

class NearestRobotStrategy implements RobotSelectionStrategy

class Robot:
int robotId, boolean isAvailable, assignTask(Task task)

class Task:
int taskId, int sourceDistance, int tagetDistance, TaskState taskState

enum TaskState:
CREATED, ASSIGNED, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, FAILED
